    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "walking away feels like it would just be more work. like i'd just have to find a new place to hide or a new way to mask. there isnt really a \"peaceful\" way to just exist when everything feels this loud and wrong. it just feels like a constant drain that never stops.",
